<view class="page theme-{{theme}}">

  <nav-bar title="数据备份与恢复" showBack="{{true}}" />

  <view class="card intro">
    <view class="title">数据备份与恢复</view>
    <view class="sub">每次改动都会自动留一份带时间戳的备份（最近 5 份）。换手机时，点「备份到文件」导出 JSON，到新设备「从文件还原」。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row bk-head">
      <text class="title">自动备份</text>
      <text class="muted">最近 5 份</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{backups.length === 0}}" class="muted" style="padding:20rpx 0">暂无自动备份，改动数据后会自动生成。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{backups}}" wx:key="ts" class="bk-row">
      <text class="bk-time">{{item.label}}</text>
      <text class="link" data-ts="{{item.ts}}" bindtap="restore">恢复</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="title" style="margin-bottom:16rpx">手动备份 / 还原</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="exportFile">📤 备份到文件</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" style="margin-top:16rpx" bindtap="importFile">📥 从文件还原</view>
    <view class="sub" style="margin-top:16rpx">导出会把数据以 JSON 发到微信聊天（文件传输助手 / 云盘）；导入从聊天里选 JSON 文件。</view>
  </view>

</view>
